{
  "key": 21534,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_YouWantTM",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s a move that doubles in power\n",
        "if the Pokémon using it is poisoned,\f",
        "paralyzed, or burned.\r",
        "I’ve got the Technical Machine for\n",
        "it right here. You want it?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_ExplainFacade",
      "en_US": [
        "Facade’s a good move for your Pokémon\n",
        "to have.\r",
        "Your opponent will think twice about\n",
        "poisoning or paralyzing your Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_2",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, welcome to the Utility Stop.\n",
        "My name is Strudel.\r",
        "Talk to my friends to see what’s\n",
        "for sale!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_4",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, my name is Imarti!\n",
        "I sell all sorts of berries.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_5",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, my name is Noghl!\n",
        "I sell evolution items.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_6",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, my name is Alaska!\n",
        "I sell a mish-mash of useful items.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_7",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_8",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_9",
      "en_US": [
        "Use LEFT and RIGHT to move 8 slots,\n",
        "or UP and DOWN to scroll."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_10",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh no, I can’t sell you anything.\r",
        "You need one of EACH of the\n",
        "following berries:\r",
        "Spelon, Pamtre, Watmel, and Durin.\n",
        "Oh, and bring me a Nomel.\r",
        "You should be able to find them\n",
        "on wild Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_11",
      "en_US": [
        "Awesome, you got all four berries!\n",
        "And a Nomel too!\r",
        "Great, now I can make a drink.\n",
        "I’m parched...time for Nomelade!\r",
        "Anyways, you’re all clear for the shop.\n",
        "Come by any time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_12",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh no, I can’t sell you anything.\r",
        "You need one of EACH of the\n",
        "following berries:\r",
        "Liechi, Ganlon, Salac, Petaya, Apicot,\n",
        "Jaboca aaaaand Rowap.\r",
        "You should be able to find them\n",
        "on wild Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_13",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah! The Petaya’s fleshy skin...\n",
        "The Rowap’s syzygial shapes...\r",
        "This will be a perfect topic for my\n",
        "Master’s thesis!\r",
        "Unovan Botanical Society, here I come!\r",
        "Oh, and you can buy from me.\n",
        "Enjoy!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_14",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}? We’ve got plenty.\n",
        "$400 apiece, how many do you want?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_15",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}? Always handy!\n",
        "$1,200 apiece, how many do you want?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_16",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}? Ooh, that’s a good one.\n",
        "$5,000 apiece, how many do you want?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_17",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}? Good eye!\n",
        "$8,000 apiece, how many do you want?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_18",
      "en_US": "Come again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "SurvivalAreaSouthHouse_Text_19",
      "en_US": [
        "You don’t have enough.\n",
        "Come again!"
      ]
    },
